msgstr "![A mode initialization and rotation fusing into one Slater determinant preparation.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-2.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Per spin sector {#per-spin-sector}"
msgstr "スピンセクターごと {#per-spin-sector}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is the same shape, but restricted to one spin half. Here, two independent initialize-then-rotate pairs, one per sector each fuse on their own into a [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"):\n"
msgstr "これは同じ形ですが、片方のスピン半分に限られます。ここでは、セクターごとに1組ずつある、初期化してから回転する2つの独立したペアが、それぞれ単独で [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") に融合されます。\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Two per-sector initialize-and-rotate pairs, each fusing into its own preparation.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-3.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Two per-sector initialize-and-rotate pairs, each fusing into its own preparation.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-3.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Global initialization, per-spin rotations {#global-initialization-per-spin-rotations}"
msgstr "全体での初期化、スピンごとの回転 {#global-initialization-per-spin-rotations}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This entails a single full-register (`2 * norb`) [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") followed by *two* [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\")actions, one on each contiguous spin half. The pass splits the global occupation at the sector boundary and emits **two** [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") gates. The two rotations might appear in either order.\n"
msgstr "これは、全レジスタ（`2 * norb`）の単一の [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") の後に、連続する各スピン半分に1つずつ、*2つ*の [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") アクションが続くものです。パスはセクターの境界でグローバルな占有を分割し、**2つ**の [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") ゲートを出力します。2つの回転はどちらの順序で現れてもかまいません。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is the shape produced by the local unitary cluster Jastrow (LUCJ) workflow (see the [LUCJ guide](lucj#lucj-transpilation)); A user places an [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") (typically the Hartree-Fock reference by using [`from_hartree_fock()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes.from_hartree_fock \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes.from_hartree_fock\")) at the front of the circuit and appends a [`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\") ansatz, whose first two per-spin orbital rotations directly follow the initialization once the ansatz is decomposed.\n"
msgstr "これは、局所ユニタリークラスターJastrow（LUCJ）ワークフローによって生成される形です（[LUCJガイド](lucj#lucj-transpilation)を参照）。ユーザーは、回路の先頭に [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\")（通常は [`from_hartree_fock()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes.from_hartree_fock \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes.from_hartree_fock\") を使ったHartree-Fock参照）を置き、[`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\") アンザッツを追加します。このアンザッツを分解すると、最初の2つのスピンごとの軌道回転が初期化の直後に続きます。\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A global initialization with two per-spin rotations fusing into two preparations.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-4.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A global initialization with two per-spin rotations fusing into two preparations.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-4.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This pattern also fires when only *one* spin half is rotated by a gate directly following the initialization, the shape produced when just one spin sector’s orbital rotation happens to sit at the front of the circuit. The rotated half becomes a [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") with its rotation, and the other half is prepared with an *identity* rotation. The identity preparation synthesizes to the reference X gates that the [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") would have emitted for that half anyway, so padding it costs no extra gates while still unlocking the reduced Slater synthesis on the rotated half:\n"
msgstr "このパターンは、初期化の直後のゲートによって片方のスピン半分だけが回転される場合にも適用されます。これは、片方のスピンセクターの軌道回転がたまたま回路の先頭に置かれた場合に生じる形です。回転される半分は、その回転とともに [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") になり、もう一方の半分は*恒等*回転で準備されます。恒等による準備は、[`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") がその半分に対してどのみち出力するはずの参照Xゲートに合成されるため、パディングしても追加のゲートコストはかからず、回転される半分では簡約されたSlater合成が利用できます。\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A global initialization with a single per-spin rotation fusing into two preparations.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-5.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A global initialization with a single per-spin rotation fusing into two preparations.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-5.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is left untouched {#what-is-left-untouched}"
msgstr "そのまま残るもの {#what-is-left-untouched}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The pass is deliberately conservative. It only fuses when the two gates genuinely compose into a Slater determinant preparation, and copies everything else through unchanged. “Immediately followed” is understood over the circuit’s data-flow graph. The [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") fuses only when the [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") is its *sole* predecessor across all of its modes. In the figures below, the before and after are identical: nothing fused.\n"
msgstr "このパスは意図的に保守的です。2つのゲートが実際にSlater行列式の準備として合成できる場合にのみ融合し、それ以外はすべて変更せずにそのままコピーします。「直後に続く」は、回路のデータフローグラフに基づいて解釈されます。[`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") が融合されるのは、すべてのモードにわたって [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") がその*唯一の*先行ゲートである場合に限られます。以下の図では、前後が同一であり、何も融合されていません。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "An operation in between {#an-operation-in-between}"
msgstr "間に入る操作 {#an-operation-in-between}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If any gate touches the modes between the initialization and the rotation, they no longer compose into a bare preparation, so nothing is merged:\n"
msgstr "初期化と回転の間のモードにいずれかのゲートが作用すると、それらはもはや単純な準備として合成できないため、何もマージされません。\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![An operation between the initialization and rotation blocks the merge.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-6.avif)\n"
msgstr "![An operation between the initialization and rotation blocks the merge.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-6.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "A partial rotation that is not a spin half {#a-partial-rotation-that-is-not-a-spin-half}"
msgstr "スピン半分ではない部分回転 {#a-partial-rotation-that-is-not-a-spin-half}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A rotation covering exactly one contiguous spin half of a full-register initialization *does* fuse (see the previous section). But a rotation on any *other* partial mode set (fewer modes than the initialization and not one of its two spin halves, such as a sub-range straddling the sector boundary) is not a per-sector preparation. Merging it would silently drop the initialization’s role on the modes it leaves out, so the pass leaves both gates in place:\n"
msgstr "全レジスタの初期化のうち、ちょうど連続する片方のスピン半分を覆う回転は、融合*されます*（前のセクションを参照）。しかし、*それ以外*の部分的なモード集合（初期化より少ないモード数で、2つのスピン半分のどちらでもないもの。たとえばセクターの境界をまたぐ部分範囲）に対する回転は、セクターごとの準備ではありません。それをマージすると、除外されたモードに対する初期化の役割が黙って失われてしまうため、パスは両方のゲートをそのまま残します。\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A partial rotation that is not a spin half is left unmerged.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-7.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A partial rotation that is not a spin half is left unmerged.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-7.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why it matters: the synthesis payoff {#why-it-matters-the-synthesis-payoff}"
msgstr "重要な理由: 合成による効果 {#why-it-matters-the-synthesis-payoff}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The merge is worthwhile because [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") synthesizes to far fewer gates than the [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") it absorbs. An $m$-electron determinant over $n$ orbitals needs at most $m(n-m)$ two-qubit rotations and no diagonal phase gates, versus the $n(n-1)/2$ rotations plus $n$ phases of the full square orbital rotation.\n"
msgstr "マージが有効なのは、[`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") が、取り込む [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") よりもはるかに少ないゲート数に合成されるためです。$n$ 個の軌道上の $m$ 電子の行列式は、2量子ビット回転が高々 $m(n-m)$ 個で済み、対角位相ゲートは不要です。これに対し、完全な正方形の軌道回転では $n(n-1)/2$ 個の回転と $n$ 個の位相が必要です。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The preset Jordan-Wigner pass manager runs [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") in its optimization stage, so this reduction happens automatically. Transpile a two-electron, six-orbital preparation all the way to a [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) and count its gates:\n"
msgstr "プリセットのJordan-Wignerパスマネージャーは、最適化ステージで [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") を実行するため、この削減は自動的に行われます。2電子・6軌道の準備を [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) まで完全にトランスパイルして、ゲート数を数えてみましょう。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Note\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  The preset runs [`MergeOrbitalRotations`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-orbital-rotations#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations\") immediately before [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\"). This matters when a *run* of consecutive [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") gates follows the initialization. The earlier pass first collapses the run into a single rotation, which [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") then contracts with the initialization into one [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"). Without that ordering, only the first rotation of the run would be absorbed and the rest would synthesize with the full square decomposition.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"注\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  プリセットは、[`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") の直前に [`MergeOrbitalRotations`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-orbital-rotations#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations\") を実行します。これは、初期化の後に連続する [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") ゲートの*列*が続く場合に重要です。先に実行されるパスがまずその列を単一の回転にまとめ、[`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") がそれを初期化と縮約して、1つの [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") にします。この順序でないと、列の最初の回転だけが取り込まれ、残りは完全な正方形の分解で合成されてしまいます。\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![The synthesized merged Slater determinant preparation.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-9.avif)\n"
msgstr "![The synthesized merged Slater determinant preparation.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-9.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare that to synthesizing the same orbital rotation on its own. With no preceding initialization there is nothing to merge, so the preset falls back to the full square decomposition, which is deeper and carries diagonal phase gates:\n"
msgstr "これを、同じ軌道回転を単独で合成した場合と比較してみましょう。先行する初期化がないとマージするものがないため、プリセットは完全な正方形の分解にフォールバックし、これはより深く、対角位相ゲートを含みます。\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![The synthesized bare orbital rotation, with its extra phase gates.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-11.avif)\n"
msgstr "![The synthesized bare orbital rotation, with its extra phase gates.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-11.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The reduced decomposition drops all six phase gates and nearly halves the two-qubit rotation count. The prepared determinant is correct up to a global phase (physically irrelevant for state preparation), which is what the phase gates would have fixed.\n"
msgstr "簡約された分解では、6つの位相ゲートがすべてなくなり、2量子ビット回転の数もほぼ半分になります。準備された行列式はグローバル位相を除いて正しく（状態準備では物理的に無関係です）、位相ゲートが固定していたのはこの位相です。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two ways to break the gate down {#two-ways-to-break-the-gate-down}"
msgstr "ゲートを分解する2つの方法 {#two-ways-to-break-the-gate-down}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") can be broken down in two different ways, and they are not interchangeable:\n"
msgstr "[`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") は2通りの方法で分解でき、両者は互換ではありません。\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`decompose()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose\") {#decompose}"
msgstr "[`decompose()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose\") {#decompose}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Expands the gate into its *definition*: the [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") of the reference followed by the full [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\"). This is equivalent to the gate as an *operator*, for any input state.\n"
msgstr "ゲートをその*定義*に展開します。参照の [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") の後に、完全な [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") が続く形です。これは、どの入力状態に対しても、*演算子*としてのゲートと等価です。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "`PrepareSlaterDeterminant.synthesis`, applied by [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") {#prepareslaterdeterminantsynthesis-applied-by-f2fsynthesis}"
msgstr "`PrepareSlaterDeterminant.synthesis`（[`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") によって適用） {#prepareslaterdeterminantsynthesis-applied-by-f2fsynthesis}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Replaces the gate with the reduced decomposition of this guide. This is equivalent to the gate only as a *state preparation*: it produces the same determinant, up to a global phase, when the modes start in the vacuum. It is cheaper precisely because it assumes that.\n"
msgstr "ゲートを、このガイドで説明した簡約された分解に置き換えます。これは、*状態準備*としてのみゲートと等価です。モードが真空から始まる場合に、グローバル位相を除いて同じ行列式を生成します。それを前提としているからこそ、より低コストになります。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the synthesis when the gate prepares a state on the vacuum, which is what the gate is for and what the transpiler does for you. Use [`decompose()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose\") when the gate has to keep acting as an operator, for example because other gates precede it on the same modes, or when you want to inspect or simulate the plain gates. The [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") pass cannot know which case it is looking at, so it is up to the circuit you give it to prepare the determinant from the vacuum.\n"
msgstr "ゲートが真空上で状態を準備する場合は、合成を使ってください。これはゲートの本来の用途であり、トランスパイラーが自動的に行うことでもあります。ゲートが演算子として作用し続ける必要がある場合（たとえば同じモード上で他のゲートが先行する場合）や、通常のゲートを調べたりシミュレートしたりしたい場合は、[`decompose()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose\") を使ってください。[`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") パスは、どちらの場合なのかを判別できないため、真空から行列式を準備するように回路を組むのは、渡す側の責任です。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Simulating a circuit with ffsim needs neither: every gate applies its whole unitary, so a circuit holding a [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") is simulated as it is, and stays on the fast path for the [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") gates around it. Breaking only the Slater gate down with `circuit.decompose(\"PrepareSlaterDeterminant\")` leaves those rotations whole, too.\n"
msgstr "ffsimで回路をシミュレートする場合は、どちらも必要ありません。すべてのゲートがそのユニタリー全体を適用するため、[`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") を含む回路はそのままシミュレートされ、その周囲の [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") ゲートに対する高速パスも維持されます。`circuit.decompose(\"PrepareSlaterDeterminant\")` でSlaterゲートだけを分解した場合も、それらの回転は分解されずに残ります。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"See also\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"), [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\"), [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\"), [`MergeOrbitalRotations`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-orbital-rotations#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations\"), [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\"), [`FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-slater-givens-decomposition#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition\"), and the [LUCJ guide](lucj#lucj-transpilation) for the workflow that produces the global-initialization pattern.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
